    }
});
```
This way, you demonstrate both the use of event delegation and conditional checks to differentiate between clicks on different children.

Remember, the goal of event delegation is to reduce redundancy and enhance maintainability in your codebase. By focusing on these aspects, you'll provide a clearer and more comprehensive explanation of event delegation.

